so it will be with My word, whatever goes out from My mouth:
it will certainly not return until all that I have willed is accomplished;
and I will prosper your ways and My commandments.

And He said, Go, and say to this people:
Hearing, you will hear and certainly not understand;
and seeing, you will see and certainly not perceive.

Guard me, Lord, from a sinner’s hand;
rescue me from unjust people,
those who devised to trip my steps.

The proud hid a trap for me
and stretched cords, traps for my feet;
along the path they set a stumbling block for me. Diapsalma.
